@PriceTracker.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Kullanıcı oluştur
POST {{PriceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo1234!",
  "displayName": "Demo Kullanıcı"
}

###
GET {{PriceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Ürün takibi ekle
POST {{PriceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/trackeditems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "productUrl": "https://www.example.com/urun/beyaz-yuruyus-ayakkabisi-38",
  "targetPrice": 1499.90,
  "title": "Beyaz yürüyüş ayakkabısı (38)"
}

###
GET {{PriceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/{{userId}}

### Fiyat kazı (scrape)
POST {{PriceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/trackeditems/{{itemId}}/check

###
POST {{PriceTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/scraper/check-all
